{"id":"n89165-2-6","stage":2,"title":"희생 · 死亡","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89165-2-6-1","ko":"뉴스에서 뭐라고 해?","zh":"新闻里说什么了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뉴스에서","meaning":"新闻，新事件","explanation":"뉴스：新闻，新事件；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"뉴스","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32795","senseId":"2","lemma":"뉴스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐라고","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해?","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5ac661dbed5720ae","term":"뉴스","zh":"新闻，新事件","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3","entryId":"32795","definition":"初次被公开的新消息。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6bbb31c33a3f49e90e3b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89165-2-6-2","ko":"홍수로 희생을 당한 사람들이 벌써 서른 명이나 된대.","zh":"据说因为洪水遇难的人数已经达到三十人了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"홍수로","meaning":"洪水","explanation":"홍수：洪水；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"홍수","audio":"/audio/98039a0b14de9ed3f622.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87568","senseId":"1","lemma":"홍수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"희생을","meaning":"死亡，丧生，殒命","explanation":"희생：死亡，丧生，殒命；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"희생","audio":"/audio/b0d9704a8bf349e268b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89165","senseId":"2","lemma":"희생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당한","meaning":"遭受，蒙受，面临","explanation":"당하다：遭受，蒙受，面临；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"당하다","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14730","senseId":"1","lemma":"당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서른","meaning":"三十","explanation":"서른：三十","readings":[{"term":"서른","audio":"/audio/e2739e161b065c33c6b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31570","senseId":"1","lemma":"서른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명이나","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"된대.","meaning":"有","explanation":"되다：有；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"4","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"98039a0b14de9ed3","term":"홍수","zh":"洪水","audio":"/audio/98039a0b14de9ed3f622.mp3","entryId":"87568","definition":"因大量降雨而突然暴涨的江河或沟渠里的水。","pronunciation":["홍수"]},{"id":"b0d9704a8bf349e2","term":"희생","zh":"死亡，丧生，殒命","audio":"/audio/b0d9704a8bf349e268b6.mp3","entryId":"89165","definition":"因事故或自然灾害等而悲痛惋惜地失去生命。","pronunciation":["히생"]},{"id":"9c2599f3570a2b0a","term":"당하다","zh":"遭受，蒙受，面临","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3","entryId":"14730","definition":"遭到意想不到的苦痛或损失。","pronunciation":["당하다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"e2739e161b065c33","term":"서른","zh":"三十","audio":"/audio/e2739e161b065c33c6b4.mp3","entryId":"31570","definition":"十的三倍的数目。","pronunciation":["서른"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"填满或达到一定的数量。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3bbb1381882a3a7f8f7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89165","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["据说因为洪水遇难的人数已经达到三十人了。","新闻里说什么了？","别着急吃，要把食物仔细嚼碎再咽下去。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["新闻里说什么了？","别着急吃，要把食物仔细嚼碎再咽下去。","据说因为洪水遇难的人数已经达到三十人了。"],"answer":2}]}
